---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Experience"
  description="Tony Pang 从软件工程、产品管理到企业 IT 运维与 AI 产品实践的结构化经历。"
>
  <header class="page-intro">
    <div>
      <p class="identity-line">Experience / Structured career history</p>
      <h1>能力迁移，比岗位名称更重要。</h1>
    </div>
    <p class="lede">
      当前公开版本按能力阶段呈现经历。公司名称、精确任职时间与客户项目尚未由本人逐项确认，因此不在这里推测。
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="path-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="path-title">职业路径</h2>
      <p>从实现软件，到定义产品，再到研究 AI 如何进入企业系统。</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="timeline-list">
      <li class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-label">Foundation</span>
        <div class="timeline-body">
          <h3>Software Engineering</h3>
          <p>iOS、Objective‑C、Xamarin、Python 与 Web 实践，形成对研发流程、系统约束和实现细节的直接理解。</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/2017/03/01/2017-03-01-tech-path-of-2016/">查看 2016 年技术路径 →</a>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-label">Transition</span>
        <div class="timeline-body">
          <h3>Product Management</h3>
          <p>从“如何实现”扩展到“为什么做、为谁做、如何定义边界与验收”，连接业务、客户、设计和研发。</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-label">Domain</span>
        <div class="timeline-body">
          <h3>Enterprise Software / IT Operations</h3>
          <p>关注 ITOM、ITSM、ITAM、CMDB、监控、告警管理，以及异构基础设施中的数据、权限与协作问题。</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-label">Current</span>
        <div class="timeline-body">
          <h3>AIOps / AI Agents</h3>
          <p>研究 AI 在告警分析、知识使用、产品工作流和软件开发中的真实边界，而不是把 AI 当作功能标签。</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="fields-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="fields-title">机器可读字段</h2>
      <p>与简历和 AI Profile 共用同一组已确认事实。</p>
    </div>
    <dl class="definition-list">
      <div class="definition-row"><dt>Current role</dt><dd>Product Manager</dd></div>
      <div class="definition-row"><dt>Industry experience</dt><dd>Approximately 10 years in software</dd></div>
      <div class="definition-row"><dt>Background</dt><dd>Software engineering and product management</dd></div>
      <div class="definition-row"><dt>Primary domains</dt><dd>ITOM, ITSM, ITAM, AIOps, AI Agents, enterprise software</dd></div>
      <div class="definition-row"><dt>Systems</dt><dd>CMDB, monitoring, observability, alert management, infrastructure</dd></div>
      <div class="definition-row"><dt>Location</dt><dd>Shanghai, China</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
